@page "/components/bubble"

<PageTitle>Bubble — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Bubble</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    One turn in a conversation. An <code>&lt;article&gt;</code> rather than a div: a thread is a
    list of separately authored things, and that is what lets a screen reader move between them
    instead of reading the whole thing as one wall.
</p>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Variants</h2>
<Example Source="BubbleVariants.razor"><BubbleVariants /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Alignment</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>end</code> is the reader's own side and <code>start</code> is the other person's, which
    is the whole grammar of a chat — and it follows the writing direction rather than the screen.
</p>
<Example Source="BubbleAlignment.razor"><BubbleAlignment /></Example>

