<h2 class="doc-h2">Show More / Collapsible</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> again: it opens with no script, survives a fragment swap, and Find
    in Page reaches inside it in most browsers — none of which a state variable manages.
</p>
